        "TileImage": "$($repository f7bb9a06-bbaa-464b-97b3-e3a2eb85711d).Image",
        "Description": "More nonsense on Hokkaido.  Why? Because of reasons! No more questions!\r\rThis time come dressed as you like (to the facility), but we need to use a high powered rifle, for completely arbitrary reasons.\r\rAlso for arbitrary reasons, no bodies can found. Though where these targets are, that should not be an issue for a seasoned pro such as yourself.",
